     'make <module_name>.synx' to synthesize functional net list
     'make <module_name>.syntx' to synthesize timing net list
     'make <module_name>.syntxp' to synthesize timing net list on project mode

--- Linter Rules ---
     'make <module_name>.lint' to run the linter on module
     'make <module_name>_tb.lint' to run the linter on module testbench

--- Clean Rules ---
